er when a name matches the existing secret classifier.\n\n- [ ] **Step 4: Verify and commit**\n\nRun:","Expected: PASS.","bash\ngit add packages/parsers/src/mule/munit.ts packages/parsers/src/mule/munit.test.ts\ngit commit -m \"feat(parsers): normalize Mule 4 MUnit\"","const","suite","parseMUnit","xml","mule4","expect","suite.tests",".toMatchObject","name","billing","api","test","testedFlows","expectedErrorType","BILLING","NOT_FOUND",".mocks",".toContainEqual","expect.objectContaining","processor","http","request",".assertions.map","a.kind",".toEqual","expect.arrayContaining","assert","that","verify","call","export","interface","MUnitTest","string","description","mocks","Array","configRef","attributes","Record","fixture","span","Span","assertions","kind","expression","expected","fixtures","MUnitSuite","dialect","mule3","tests","diagnostics","ExtractDiagnostic","git","add","commit","feat","parsers","normalize","Mule","MUnit"],"links":[]}}
